@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L2：Kafka 发送 Provider 协作

participant "MessageSendExecutor" as Executor
participant "KafkaMessageProvider" as KafkaProvider
participant "KafkaProducer" as KafkaProducer
queue "Kafka Broker" as KafkaBroker

Executor -> KafkaProvider: send(ProviderSendRequest)
KafkaProvider -> KafkaProvider: build ProducerRecord(topic, key, body)
KafkaProvider -> KafkaProvider: copy headers / system headers
KafkaProvider -> KafkaProducer: send(record, callback)
KafkaProducer -> KafkaBroker: produce request

alt Broker 明确确认
  KafkaBroker --> KafkaProducer: RecordMetadata(topic, partition, offset)
  KafkaProducer --> KafkaProvider: callback(metadata, null)
  KafkaProvider --> Executor: ProviderSendResult.CONFIRMED
else 认证、授权、非法 topic、消息过大、序列化错误
  KafkaProducer --> KafkaProvider: callback(null, exception)
  KafkaProvider --> Executor: ProviderSendResult.REJECTED / FAILED(non-retryable)
else 网络抖动 / RetriableException
  KafkaProducer --> KafkaProvider: callback(null, exception)
  KafkaProvider --> Executor: ProviderSendResult.FAILED + NETWORK_ERROR
else Future 超时 / ack 未返回
  KafkaProducer --x KafkaProvider: future not completed in confirmTimeout
  KafkaProvider --> Executor: ProviderSendResult.UNKNOWN + TIMEOUT
end

note over Executor,KafkaProvider
Kafka Provider 只负责把 Kafka 客户端结果转成 ProviderSendResult。
是否重试由 message-core 的 MessageSendRetryClassifier 判断。
end note
@enduml
